    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      431.08,
      289.02,
      496.4
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      497.83,
      286.74,
      587.35
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired : Two allotments of land in Total Extent of about 2.9078 Hectare depicted in PPMADA 2841 Prepared by the Surveyor General Situated in the Village of Pattiyadichenai in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Koralaipattu in Batticaloa District, Eastern Province morefully described below:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      588.8,
      286.63,
      658.68
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01\u2014Name of the Land: Pachchai-madukadu and Muthiyanmadukadu; Description: Garden Contains 02 Coconut trees, 16 Palmyra trees, 01 Mango tree and a masonry Well; Claimant: Saravanamuthu Natkunam; Extent: 0.9594 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      660.12,
      286.68,
      715.76
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries (Lot 01): North by TP 169428 & Road; East: Road & TP 169428; South: TP 169428, TP 304539 & Lot 02; West : Lot 02 TP 304539 & TP 169428.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.92,
      539.39,
      391.56
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 02\u2014Name of the Land: Pachchai-madukadu and Muthiyanmadukadu; Description: Garden Contains 12 Palmyra trees: Claimant: Natkunam Wimalenthiran; Extent: 1.9484 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      403.07,
      539.4,
      452.24
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries ( Lot 02): North by : TP 304539, TP 169428, Lot 01; East: Lot 01, TP 169428 and TP 304539; South: TP 304539; West: TP 304539.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      473.6,
      581.63,
      598.64
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Lands are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Koralaipattu Secretary\u2019s Office on 28th February, 2017 at 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 21st February, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation and the details of the computation of such compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. All deeds and documents in support of the claims should be produced before me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      593.78,
      552.61,
      713.36
    ],
    "text": "V. VASUTHOEVAN SLAS-1 Divisional Secretary, Divisional Secretariat, Koralaipattu. 06th February, 2017. 02 - 835",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
